hey it's Evan and I believe it's  important to thank the people who are  making a difference in your business and  your life because being an entrepreneur  is hard and we all have battles to fight  and it's the people around us who helped  us get over everything you can't do it  yourself and sometimes it's nice just to  sit back and think about the people  who've helped you along your way and  send them a nice thank you to make them  feel good and to make you feel good and  grateful for their help and their  friendship so today i want to thank  Shawn Moffitt now Shawn and I first met  at a coffee shop that was a friend of  mine it was his coffee shop that she had  called little nicky's and it got run  into by a bus and imagine you know  running the business is hard enough  you've got this bus that comes into your  building and you've got to close down  and I felt so bad for this coffee shop  that i sent an email to my newsletter  list and said hey I'd like to support  this entrepreneur friend of mine  everybody in Toronto if you're here  let's all meet up a little nicky's when  they open up again and you know this  time this day and we'll go support them  and surprise them and so we did and we  kind of filled the coffee shop and Shawn  was one of the people who came out and  the one of the things that always  impressed me about sean is how he's  really giving and caring and likes to  help other people and so he came out to  help the owner of little nicky's and to  meet me and we talked business for a  little bit and from there we met up a  couple times and one of the things I'm  most grateful to shine about is he  introduced me to my now agent and he is  at the same agency that I'm at and we  came up with a few ideas on how to work  together and in that discussion he said  well this idea came from my agent and  I've never heard of an agent for  business people for for you know thought  leaders you think of agents for for  baseball players and athletes not kind  of stuff but there's an agent for  business people and thought leaders and  so he set up an introduction and I ended  up becoming I guess on the roster and a  lot of things have happened since then I  got my radio show working on a book deal  the videos  got a lot better I've gotten some great  coaching and that wouldn't have happened  without the introduction from Shawn and  again he was just trying to help out and  try to help a fellow entrepreneur and  you know he knows about the struggles of  running the business and so Sean I  really appreciate that all the all the  help you've given me especially in the  past year or so and I wanted to make  this video to say thank you so you know  for everybody watching there's somebody  in your life who has helped you with  your business get to where it is even if  it's just supporting you and saying hey  I believe in you and this is important  work that you're doing take some time  today to thank them it doesn't have to  be a video it can't be an email it can  be a handwritten note you can you know  get them a gift card but it doesn't have  to be something that you're spending a  lot of money on just just show them that  you care about them that you appreciate  them feel the gratitude it'll make you  feel better it'll make them feel better  and everybody will have a great day so  thanks for watching if you guys like  this video give it a thumbs up below you  have a question a comment leave it below  in the comments I make a video response  thank you so much for watching and I'll  see you soon
 

